  "passage": {
    "text": "Inventory management is also a key part of logistics management, and it is vital for making sure that the right items are available in the right places when they are needed. This includes raw materials, supplies, and finished goods. Effective inventory management allows companies to meet demand during seasonal peaks or changes in market trends. At the same time, it ensures that there is not too much excess inventory taking up valuable storage space during periods of low demand.",
